1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,760
Sometimes you just have to accept the situation. Understand that it's okay. It happens. It's life.

2
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:14,100
Not every ending needs an explanation. Not every loss deserves another chance.

3
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:23,480
Some chapters are only meant to teach, not to stay. And one day, you'll thank life for what it didn't let you keep.
